            "activity_label": {
                "pl": "Porz\u0105dek obrad w \u015brod\u0119 - Wniosek grupy PPE (Przygotowanie specjalnego posiedzenia Rady Europejskiej w lutym, w szczeg\u00f3lno\u015bci konieczno\u015b\u0107 opracowania zr\u00f3wnowa\u017conych rozwi\u0105za\u0144 w dziedzinie azylu i migracji)",
                "ga": "Cl\u00e1r oibre D\u00e9 C\u00e9adaoin - Iarraidh \u00f3n nGr\u00fapa PPE (Ullmh\u00fach\u00e1n don Chruinni\u00fa Urghn\u00e1ch den Chomhairle Eorpach \u00f3 mh\u00ed Feabhra, go h\u00e1irithe an g\u00e1 at\u00e1 le r\u00e9itigh inbhuanaithe a fhorbairt i r\u00e9imse an tearmainn agus na himirce)",
                "it": "Ordine del giorno di mercoled\u00ec - Richiesta del gruppo PPE (Preparazione della riunione straordinaria del Consiglio europeo di febbraio, in particolare la necessit\u00e0 di sviluppare soluzioni sostenibili in materia di asilo e migrazione)",
                "fr": "Ordre du jour de mercredi - Demande du groupe PPE (Pr\u00e9paration de la r\u00e9union extraordinaire du Conseil europ\u00e9en du mois de f\u00e9vrier, en particulier la n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 de mettre en place des solutions durables dans le domaine de l'asile et de la migration) - Wednesday\u2019s Agenda - Request from the PPE Group (Preparation of the Special European Council meeting of February, in particular the need to develop sustainable solutions in the area of asylum and migration) - Tagesordnung f\u00fcr Mittwoch - Antrag der PPE-Fraktion (Vorbereitung der au\u00dferordentlichen Tagung des Europ\u00e4ischen Rates im Februar, insbesondere das Erfordernis, dauerhafte L\u00f6sungen im Bereich Asyl und Migration zu entwickeln)",
                "et": "Kolmap\u00e4eva p\u00e4evakord - fraktsiooni PPE taotlus (Euroopa \u00dclemkogu veebruarikuise erakorralise kohtumise ettevalmistamine, eelk\u00f5ige vajadus t\u00f6\u00f6tada v\u00e4lja kestlikud lahendused varjupaiga ja r\u00e4nde valdkonnas)",
                "es": "Orden del d\u00eda del mi\u00e9rcoles - Solicitud del Grupo PPE (Preparaci\u00f3n de la reuni\u00f3n extraordinaria del Consejo Europeo de febrero, en particular la necesidad de desarrollar soluciones sostenibles en materia de asilo y migraci\u00f3n)",
                "lt": "Tre\u010diadienio darbotvark\u0117 - PPE frakcijos pra\u0161ymas (Pasirengimas specialiajam Europos Vadov\u0173 Tarybos susitikimui, ypa\u010d b\u016btinyb\u0117 rasti tvarius sprendimus prieglobs\u010dio ir migracijos srityje)",
                "cs": "St\u0159ede\u010dn\u00ed po\u0159ad jedn\u00e1n\u00ed - \u017e\u00e1dost skupiny PPE (p\u0159\u00edprava mimo\u0159\u00e1dn\u00e9ho zased\u00e1n\u00ed Evropsk\u00e9 rady v \u00fanoru, zejm\u00e9na pot\u0159eba vypracovat urd\u017eiteln\u00e1 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed v oblasti azylu a migrace)",
                "el": "\u0397\u03bc\u03b5\u03c1\u03ae\u03c3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03b4\u03b9\u03ac\u03c4\u03b1\u03be\u03b7 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03a4\u03b5\u03c4\u03ac\u03c1\u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 - \u0391\u03af\u03c4\u03b7\u03bc\u03b1 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03bf\u03bc\u03ac\u03b4\u03b1\u03c2 PPE (\u03a0\u03c1\u03bf\u03b5\u03c4\u03bf\u03b9\u03bc\u03b1\u03c3\u03af\u03b1 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03ad\u03ba\u03c4\u03b1\u03ba\u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03c3\u03c5\u03bd\u03cc\u03b4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u0395\u03c5\u03c1\u03c9\u03c0\u03b1\u03ca\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd \u03a3\u03c5\u03bc\u03b2\u03bf\u03c5\u03bb\u03af\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03a6\u03b5\u03b2\u03c1\u03bf\u03c5\u03b1\u03c1\u03af\u03bf\u03c5, \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b9\u03b4\u03af\u03c9\u03c2 \u03b7 \u03b1\u03bd\u03ac\u03b3\u03ba\u03b7 \u03b1\u03bd\u03ac\u03c0\u03c4\u03c5\u03be\u03b7\u03c2 \u03b2\u03b9\u03ce\u03c3\u03b9\u03bc\u03c9\u03bd \u03bb\u03cd\u03c3\u03b5\u03c9\u03bd \u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u03c4\u03bf\u03bc\u03ad\u03b1 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03b1\u03c3\u03cd\u03bb\u03bf\u03c5 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03bc\u03b5\u03c4\u03b1\u03bd\u03ac\u03c3\u03c4\u03b5\u03c5\u03c3\u03b7\u03c2)",
                "mt": "L-a\u0121enda tal-Erbg\u0127a - Talba tal-Grupp PPE (T\u0127ejjija tal-laqg\u0127a straordinarja tal-Kunsill Ewropew, b'mod partikolari l-\u0127tie\u0121a li ji\u0121u \u017cviluppati soluzzjonijiet sostenibbli fil-qasam tal-a\u017cil u l-migrazzjoni)",
                "lv": "Tre\u0161dienas darba k\u0101rt\u012bba - PPE grupas piepras\u012bjums (Gatavo\u0161an\u0101s \u012bpa\u0161ajai Eiropadomes san\u0101ksmei febru\u0101r\u012b, jo \u012bpa\u0161i nepiecie\u0161am\u012bba izstr\u0101d\u0101t ilgtsp\u0113j\u012bgus risin\u0101jumus patv\u0113ruma un migr\u0101cijas jom\u0101)",
                "sv": "F\u00f6redragningslistan f\u00f6r onsdagen \u2013 Beg\u00e4ran fr\u00e5n PPE-gruppen (F\u00f6rberedelser inf\u00f6r Europeiska r\u00e5dets extra m\u00f6te i februari, s\u00e4rskilt behovet av att utveckla h\u00e5llbara l\u00f6sningar p\u00e5 asyl- och migrationsomr\u00e5det)",
                "pt": "Ordem do dia de quarta-feira - Pedido do Grupo PPE (Prepara\u00e7\u00e3o da reuni\u00e3o extraordin\u00e1ria do Conselho Europeu de fevereiro, em particular a necessidade de desenvolver solu\u00e7\u00f5es sustent\u00e1veis no dom\u00ednio do asilo e da migra\u00e7\u00e3o)",
                "sl": "Dnevni red v sredo - zahteva skupine PPE (Priprave na februarsko izredno zasedanje Evropskega sveta, zlasti potreba po razvoju trajnostnih re\u0161itev na podro\u010dju azila in migracij)",
                "ro": "Ordinea de zi de miercuri - Cerere a Grupului PPE (Preg\u0103tirea reuniunii extraordinare a Consiliului European din februarie, \u00een special necesitatea de a dezvolta solu\u021bii sustenabile \u00een domeniul azilului \u0219i migra\u021biei)",
                "hu": "Szerdai napirend - a PPE k\u00e9pvisel\u0151csoport k\u00e9releme (Az Eur\u00f3pai Tan\u00e1cs febru\u00e1ri rendk\u00edv\u00fcli \u00fcl\u00e9s\u00e9nek el\u0151k\u00e9sz\u00edt\u00e9se, k\u00fcl\u00f6n\u00f6s tekintettel fenntarthat\u00f3 megold\u00e1sok kidolgoz\u00e1s\u00e1ra a mened\u00e9kjog \u00e9s a migr\u00e1ci\u00f3 ter\u00fclet\u00e9n)",
                "de": "Tagesordnung f\u00fcr Mittwoch - Antrag der PPE-Fraktion (Vorbereitung der au\u00dferordentlichen Tagung des Europ\u00e4ischen Rates im Februar, insbesondere das Erfordernis, dauerhafte L\u00f6sungen im Bereich Asyl und Migration zu entwickeln)",
                "en": "Wednesday\u2019s agenda \u2013 Request from the PPE Group (preparation of the special European Council meeting of February, in particular the need to develop sustainable solutions in the area of asylum and migration)",
                "hr": "Dnevni red za srijedu - Zahtjev Kluba zastupnika PPE-a (Priprema za izvanredni sastanak Europskog vije\u0107a u velja\u010di, posebno potreba za pronalaskom odr\u017eivih rje\u0161enja u podru\u010dju azila i migracija)",
                "bg": "\u0414\u043d\u0435\u0432\u0435\u043d \u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0437\u0430 \u0441\u0440\u044f\u0434\u0430 - \u0418\u0441\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043f\u0430\u0442\u0430 PPE (\u041f\u043e\u0434\u0433\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0438\u0437\u0432\u044a\u043d\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0442\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0441\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u0415\u0432\u0440\u043e\u043f\u0435\u0439\u0441\u043a\u0438\u044f \u0441\u044a\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u0444\u0435\u0432\u0440\u0443\u0430\u0440\u0438, \u0438 \u043f\u043e-\u043a\u043e\u043d\u043a\u0440\u0435\u0442\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0431\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043c\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0442\u0430 \u043e\u0442 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0439\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0438 \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0432 \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0442\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0443\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0438\u0449\u0435\u0442\u043e \u0438 \u043c\u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f\u0442a)",
                "sk": "Program na stredu - \u017eiados\u0165 skupiny PPE (Pr\u00edprava mimoriadneho zasadnutia Eur\u00f3pskej rady vo febru\u00e1ri, najm\u00e4 potreba vypracova\u0165 udr\u017eate\u013en\u00e9 rie\u0161enia v oblasti azylu a migr\u00e1cie)",
                "da": "Dagsorden for onsdag \u2013 anmodning fra PPE-Gruppen (Forberedelse af det ekstraordin\u00e6re m\u00f8de i Det Europ\u00e6iske R\u00e5d i februar, navnlig behovet for at udvikle b\u00e6redygtige l\u00f8sninger p\u00e5 migrations- og asylomr\u00e5det)",
                "nl": "Agenda van woensdag - Verzoek van de PPE-Fractie (Voorbereiding van de buitengewone bijeenkomst van de Europese Raad van februari, met name de noodzaak om duurzame oplossingen op het gebied van asiel en migratie uit te werken)",
                "fi": "Keskiviikon esityslista \u2013 PPE-ryhm\u00e4n pyynt\u00f6 (Helmikuussa pidett\u00e4v\u00e4n Eurooppa-neuvoston ylim\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4isen kokouksen valmistelu, erityisesti tarve kehitt\u00e4\u00e4 turvapaikka- ja muuttoliikeasioissa kest\u00e4vi\u00e4 ratkaisuja)"
